  "description": "The Kinesis CX1 cyclocross frame has been designed to offer versatility and answer the questions you’ve been thinking about… should I go disc or cantilever? Do I need a race bike or something I can hack around the woods on and then do my daily commute as well? Should I go Red or Blue?.With the CX1 you can do all of them, whether you’re starting out at cross racing or just want a winter machine to hack around the woods with your mates it’ll do it all.You can build it up with cantilever brakes to start with and then switch to disc later down the line.We designed the Kinesis CX1 frame to fit in around your needs, really all you’ve got to choose is the colour. So what’s it to be Red or Blue?",
